function resetProgress(){if(confirm('정말 모든 학습 기록을 초기화할까요? 자동 백업은 별도로 남아 복원할 수 있습니다.')){saveBackupSnapshot('초기화 직전');state={...defaultState,cards:{},roles:{},history:[]};saveState();closeSettings();updateHome();toast('학습 기록을 초기화했습니다. 필요하면 자동 백업에서 복원할 수 있습니다.')}}
window.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(!document.getElementById('lessonView').classList.contains('on'))return;if(e.code==='Space'&&current()?.type==='recall'&&document.getElementById('answer')?.classList.contains('hidden')){e.preventDefault();revealRecall()}});
window.speechSynthesis&&speechSynthesis.addEventListener?.('voiceschanged',()=>refreshVoiceOptions());
let deferredInstallPrompt=null;
window.addEventListener('beforeinstallprompt',e=>{e.preventDefault();deferredInstallPrompt=e;document.getElementById('installBtn')?.classList.remove('hidden')});
document.getElementById('installBtn').onclick=async()=>{
  if(deferredInstallPrompt){deferredInstallPrompt.prompt();try{await deferredInstallPrompt.userChoice}catch(e){}deferredInstallPrompt=null;return}
  const ios=/iphone|ipad|ipod/i.test(navigator.userAgent);
  alert(ios?'iPhone/iPad: Safari의 공유 버튼 → 홈 화면에 추가 → 웹 앱으로 열기를 선택하세요.':'Chrome/Edge 메뉴에서 “앱 설치” 또는 “홈 화면에 추가”를 선택하세요. GitHub Pages 주소로 접속한 상태에서 설치할 수 있습니다.');
};


// ===== v5.2 문법·활용 사전 / 동사 변형 / 문장 완성 훈련 =====
const VERB_FORM_DEFS=[
  {key:'ます',label:'ます형',hint:'정중하게 말할 때'},
  {key:'て',label:'て형',hint:'연결·부탁·진행의 기본'},
  {key:'た',label:'た형',hint:'과거·완료의 기본'},
  {key:'ない',label:'ない형(부정형)',hint:'~하지 않다'},
  {key:'가능',label:'가능형',hint:'~할 수 있다'},
  {key:'의지',label:'의지형',hint:'~하자 / ~하려고'},
  {key:'ば',label:'ば형',hint:'~하면'},
  {key:'수동',label:'수동형',hint:'~당하다 / ~받다'},
  {key:'사역',label:'사역형',hint:'~하게 하다'}
];
const ENDING_PATTERNS=[
  {id:'plain_think',pattern:'〜と思います',meaning:'~할 것이라고 생각합니다',connect:'사전형 + と思います',need:'dict',build:v=>`${v.jp}と思います`},
  {id:'vol_think',pattern:'〜ようと思います',meaning:'~하려고 합니다',connect:'의지형 + と思います',need:'의지',build:v=>joinVerb(v,'의지','と思います')},
  {id:'tai',pattern:'〜たいです',meaning:'~하고 싶습니다',connect:'ます어간 + たいです',need:'ます',build:v=>stemMasu(v)+'たいです'},
  {id:'tsumori',pattern:'〜つもりです',meaning:'~할 생각입니다',connect:'사전형 + つもりです',need:'dict',build:v=>`${v.jp}つもりです`},
  {id:'yotei',pattern:'〜予定です',meaning:'~할 예정입니다',connect:'사전형 + 予定です',need:'dict',build:v=>`${v.jp}予定です`},
  {id:'te_kudasai',pattern:'〜てください',meaning:'~해 주세요',connect:'て형 + ください',need:'て',build:v=>joinVerb(v,'て','ください')},
  {id:'te_itadake',pattern:'〜ていただけますか',meaning:'~해 주실 수 있을까요?',connect:'て형 + いただけますか',need:'て',build:v=>joinVerb(v,'て','いただけますか')},
  {id:'te_mo_ii',pattern:'〜てもいいですか',meaning:'~해도 될까요?',connect:'て형 + もいいですか',need:'て',build:v=>joinVerb(v,'て','もいいですか')},
  {id:'te_wa_ikenai',pattern:'〜てはいけません',meaning:'~해서는 안 됩니다',connect:'て형 + はいけません',need:'て',build:v=>joinVerb(v,'て','はいけません')},
  {id:'nakereba',pattern:'〜なければなりません',meaning:'~해야 합니다',connect:'ない형의 ない → なければ + なりません',need:'ない',build:v=>replaceNai(v,'なければなりません')},
  {id:'nakutemo',pattern:'〜なくてもいいです',meaning:'~하지 않아도 됩니다',connect:'ない형의 ない → なくて + もいいです',need:'ない',build:v=>replaceNai(v,'なくてもいいです')},
  {id:'te_miru',pattern:'〜てみます',meaning:'~해 보겠습니다',connect:'て형 + みます',need:'て',build:v=>joinVerb(v,'て','みます')},
  {id:'te_oku',pattern:'〜ておきます',meaning:'미리 ~해 두겠습니다',connect:'て형 + おきます',need:'て',build:v=>joinVerb(v,'て','おきます')},
  {id:'te_iru',pattern:'〜ています',meaning:'~하고 있습니다',connect:'て형 + います',need:'て',build:v=>joinVerb(v,'て','います')}
];
const ENDING_GRAMMAR_MAP={vol_think:'grammar-17',tai:'grammar-16',tsumori:'grammar-18',yotei:'grammar-19',te_kudasai:'grammar-1',te_itadake:'grammar-4',te_mo_ii:'grammar-9',te_wa_ikenai:'grammar-10',nakereba:'grammar-11',nakutemo:'grammar-12',te_miru:'grammar-30',te_oku:'grammar-28',te_iru:'grammar-26'};
let dictionaryTab='verbs',dictionaryVerbGroup='all',dictionaryLimit=60,dictionaryQuery='';
let practiceSession=null;

function ensurePracticeState(){
  if(!state.drills||typeof state.drills!=='object')state.drills={};
  for(const k of ['verb','ending'])if(!state.drills[k])state.drills[k]={sessions:0,firstTotal:0,firstCorrect:0,completed:0};
  return state.drills;
}
function practiceStats(kind){ensurePracticeState();return state.drills[kind]}
function updatePracticeHome(){
  if(!document.getElementById('verbDrillAcc'))return;ensurePracticeState();
  for(const [kind,prefix] of [['verb','verbDrill'],['ending','endingDrill']]){let x=state.drills[kind],acc=x.firstTotal?Math.round(x.firstCorrect/x.firstTotal*100)+'%':'-';document.getElementById(prefix+'Acc').textContent=acc;document.getElementById(prefix+'Sessions').textContent=x.sessions||0}
  let b=document.getElementById('practiceResumeBtn'),ps=state.practiceSession;if(b){if(ps&&Array.isArray(ps.items)&&ps.items.length){b.classList.remove('hidden');b.textContent=`↩ ${ps.kind==='verb'?'동사 변형':'문장 완성'} 이어하기 · ${Math.min((ps.idx||0)+1,ps.items.length)}/${ps.items.length}`}else b.classList.add('hidden')}
}
function getVerbs(){return DB.cards.filter(c=>c.kind==='verb'&&c.jp&&c.extra)}
function validForm(v,key){let x=v?.extra?.[key];return x&&!["–","-","—","―"].includes(String(x).trim())?cleanJP(x):''}
function stemMasu(v){let x=validForm(v,'ます');return x.endsWith('ます')?x.slice(0,-2):''}
function joinVerb(v,key,suffix){let x=validForm(v,key);return x?x+suffix:''}
function replaceNai(v,suffix){let x=validForm(v,'ない');return x&&x.endsWith('ない')?x.slice(0,-2)+suffix:''}
function endingAnswer(p,v){try{let x=p.build(v);return x&&!x.includes('–')?cleanJP(x):''}catch(e){return ''}}
function currentModeVerbs(){let vs=getVerbs();if(state.mode==='beginner')return vs.filter(v=>v.level==='기초');if(state.mode==='business'||state.mode==='n3')return vs.filter(v=>v.level==='N3·비즈니스');return vs}

function openGrammarDictionary(tab='verbs'){dictionaryTab=tab;dictionaryLimit=60;dictionaryQuery='';showView('dictionaryView');renderDictionary()}
function setDictionaryTab(tab){dictionaryTab=tab;dictionaryLimit=60;dictionaryQuery='';renderDictionary()}
function setDictionaryVerbGroup(group){dictionaryVerbGroup=group;dictionaryLimit=60;renderDictionary()}
function dictionarySearchChanged(el){dictionaryQuery=String(el?.value||'');dictionaryLimit=60;if(dictionaryTab==='verbs')renderVerbDictionary();else if(dictionaryTab==='endings')renderEndingDictionary();else renderGrammarDictionary()}
function loadMoreDictionary(){dictionaryLimit+=60;renderDictionary()}
function setDictionaryActiveTabs(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-dtab]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('on',b.dataset.dtab===dictionaryTab))}
function renderDictionary(){
  setDictionaryActiveTabs();let controls=document.getElementById('dictionaryControls'),box=document.getElementById('dictionaryContent'),count=document.getElementById('dictionaryCount');if(!controls||!box)return;
  if(dictionaryTab==='verbs'){
    controls.innerHTML=`<div class="dictControls"><input id="dictionarySearch" class="dictSearch" value="${escapeHtml(dictionaryQuery)}" placeholder="동사·읽기·뜻 검색" oninput="dictionarySearchChanged(this)"><div class="groupSeg">${['all','1그룹','2그룹','3그룹'].map(g=>`<button class="${dictionaryVerbGroup===g?'on':''}" onclick="setDictionaryVerbGroup('${g}')">${g==='all'?'전체':g}</button>`).join('')}</div></div>`;
    renderVerbDictionary();
  }else if(dictionaryTab==='endings'){
    controls.innerHTML=`<div class="dictControls"><input id="dictionarySearch" class="dictSearch" value="${escapeHtml(dictionaryQuery)}" placeholder="문형·뜻 검색" oninput="dictionarySearchChanged(this)"><button class="iconbtn" onclick="startEndingDrill()">🧩 바로 연습</button></div>`;renderEndingDictionary();
  }else{
    controls.innerHTML=`<div class="dictControls"><input id="dictionarySearch" class="dictSearch" value="${escapeHtml(dictionaryQuery)}" placeholder="문법·뜻·예문 검색" oninput="dictionarySearchChanged(this)"><button class="iconbtn" onclick="startVerbDrill()">🔄 동사 변형 연습</button></div>`;renderGrammarDictionary();
  }
}
function verbBaseAudio(v){return isJapaneseReading(v?.reading)?v.reading:(v?.jp||'')}
function verbFormAudio(v,key){
  if(!v)return '';let r=String(v.reading||'').trim();if(!isJapaneseReading(r))return validForm(v,key);if(!key)return r;
  if(r.endsWith('する')){let stem=r.slice(0,-2),m={'ます':'します','て':'して','た':'した','ない':'しない','가능':'できる','의지':'しよう','ば':'すれば','수동':'される','사역':'させる'};return stem+(m[key]||'')}
  if(r==='くる'||r.endsWith('くる')){let stem=r.slice(0,-2),m={'ます':'きます','て':'きて','た':'きた','ない':'こない','가능':'こられる','의지':'こよう','ば':'くれば','수동':'こられる','사역':'こさせる'};return stem+(m[key]||'')}
  let group=String(v.category||''),last=r.slice(-1),stem=r.slice(0,-1);
  if(group.includes('2')){let m={'ます':'ます','て':'て','た':'た','ない':'ない','가능':'られる','의지':'よう','ば':'れば','수동':'られる','사역':'させる'};return stem+(m[key]||'')}
  if(r==='ある'&&key==='ない')return 'ない';
  let map={
    'う':{'ます':'います','て':'って','た':'った','ない':'わない','가능':'える','의지':'おう','ば':'えば','수동':'われる','사역':'わせる'},
    'く':{'ます':'きます','て':'いて','た':'いた','ない':'かない','가능':'ける','의지':'こう','ば':'けば','수동':'かれる','사역':'かせる'},
    'ぐ':{'ます':'ぎます','て':'いで','た':'いだ','ない':'がない','가능':'げる','의지':'ごう','ば':'げば','수동':'がれる','사역':'がせる'},
    'す':{'ます':'します','て':'して','た':'した','ない':'さない','가능':'せる','의지':'そう','ば':'せば','수동':'される','사역':'させる'},
    'つ':{'ます':'ちます','て':'って','た':'った','ない':'たない','가능':'てる','의지':'とう','ば':'てば','수동':'たれる','사역':'たせる'},
    'ぬ':{'ます':'にます','て':'んで','た':'んだ','ない':'なない','가능':'ねる','의지':'のう','ば':'ねば','수동':'なれる','사역':'なせる'},
    'ぶ':{'ます':'びます','て':'んで','た':'んだ','ない':'ばない','가능':'べる','의지':'ぼう','ば':'べば','수동':'ばれる','사역':'ばせる'},
    'む':{'ます':'みます','て':'んで','た':'んだ','ない':'まない','가능':'める','의지':'もう','ば':'めば','수동':'まれる','사역':'ませる'},
    'る':{'ます':'ります','て':'って','た':'った','ない':'らない','가능':'れる','의지':'ろう','ば':'れば','수동':'られる','사역':'らせる'}
  };
  if(r==='いく'&&(key==='て'||key==='た'))return key==='て'?'いって':'いった';
  return stem+((map[last]||{})[key]||validForm(v,key))
}
function endingAudioTarget(p,v){
  if(!p||!v)return '';let base=verbBaseAudio(v),te=verbFormAudio(v,'て'),nai=verbFormAudio(v,'ない'),vol=verbFormAudio(v,'의지'),masu=verbFormAudio(v,'ます'),mstem=masu.endsWith('ます')?masu.slice(0,-2):masu;
  switch(p.id){case 'plain_think':return base+'とおもいます';case 'vol_think':return vol+'とおもいます';case 'tai':return mstem+'たいです';case 'tsumori':return base+'つもりです';case 'yotei':return base+'よていです';case 'te_kudasai':return te+'ください';case 'te_itadake':return te+'いただけますか';case 'te_mo_ii':return te+'もいいですか';case 'te_wa_ikenai':return te+'はいけません';case 'nakereba':return nai.endsWith('ない')?nai.slice(0,-2)+'なければなりません':nai;case 'nakutemo':return nai.endsWith('ない')?nai.slice(0,-2)+'なくてもいいです':nai;case 'te_miru':return te+'みます';case 'te_oku':return te+'おきます';case 'te_iru':return te+'います';default:return endingAnswer(p,v)}
}
function practiceAudioTarget(it){let v=practiceVerb(it);return it?.kind==='verb'?verbFormAudio(v,it.formKey):endingAudioTarget(practicePattern(it),v)}
function renderVerbDictionary(){
  let q=dictionaryQuery.trim().toLowerCase(),verbs=getVerbs().filter(v=>dictionaryVerbGroup==='all'||v.category===dictionaryVerbGroup).filter(v=>!q||[v.jp,v.reading,v.ko].some(x=>String(x||'').toLowerCase().includes(q)));
  let count=document.getElementById('dictionaryCount');if(count)count.textContent=`${verbs.length}개`;
  let rules=`<div class="ruleGrid"><div class="ruleCard"><b>1그룹</b><small>う·つ·る→って/った, む·ぶ·ぬ→んで/んだ, く→いて, ぐ→いで, す→して. ない형은 あ단(う→わ)으로.</small></div><div class="ruleCard"><b>2그룹</b><small>끝의 る를 빼고 ます·て·た·ない를 붙입니다. 예: 食べる→食べて→食べた→食べない.</small></div><div class="ruleCard"><b>3그룹</b><small>する·来る 계열은 불규칙입니다. 각 활용형의 🔊 버튼으로 실제 읽기도 같이 확인하세요.</small></div></div>`;
  let shown=verbs.slice(0,dictionaryLimit),list=shown.map(v=>`<details class="verbEntry"><summary><div class="entryTitle"><b>${escapeHtml(v.jp)}</b>${v.reading?` <span class="entryReading">${escapeHtml(v.reading)}</span>`:''}<small>${escapeHtml(v.ko)}</small></div><span class="entryTag">${escapeHtml(v.category||'')}</span></summary><div class="conjGrid"><div class="conjCell"><span>기본형</span><b>${escapeHtml(v.jp)}</b><small>${escapeHtml(v.reading||'')}</small><button class="miniAudio" onclick="event.preventDefault();event.stopPropagation();speakText('${encodeURIComponent(verbBaseAudio(v))}')">🔊</button></div>${VERB_FORM_DEFS.map(f=>{let form=validForm(v,f.key);return `<div class="conjCell"><span>${escapeHtml(f.label)}</span><b>${escapeHtml(form||'—')}</b><small>${escapeHtml(verbFormMeaning(v,f.key))}</small>${form?`<button class="miniAudio" onclick="event.preventDefault();event.stopPropagation();speakText('${encodeURIComponent(verbFormAudio(v,f.key))}')">🔊</button>`:''}</div>`}).join('')}</div></details>`).join('');
  document.getElementById('dictionaryContent').innerHTML=rules+`<div class="dictList">${list||'<div class="footerNote">검색 결과가 없습니다.</div>'}</div>${verbs.length>shown.length?`<div style="text-align:center;margin-top:12px"><button class="iconbtn" onclick="loadMoreDictionary()">더 보기 (${shown.length}/${verbs.length})</button></div>`:''}`
}
function patternExample(p){let g=DB.cards.find(c=>c.id===ENDING_GRAMMAR_MAP[p.id]);return g?.extra?.example||''}
function patternTranslation(p){let g=DB.cards.find(c=>c.id===ENDING_GRAMMAR_MAP[p.id]);return g?.extra?.translation||''}
function renderEndingDictionary(){
  let q=dictionaryQuery.trim().toLowerCase(),rows=ENDING_PATTERNS.filter(p=>!q||[p.pattern,p.meaning,p.connect,patternExample(p),patternTranslation(p)].some(x=>String(x||'').toLowerCase().includes(q)));let count=document.getElementById('dictionaryCount');if(count)count.textContent=`${rows.length}개`;
  document.getElementById('dictionaryContent').innerHTML=`<div class="footerNote" style="text-align:left;margin:4px 0 12px">문장 끝을 통째로 외우면 회화가 빨라집니다. 예문이 있는 문형은 🔊로 읽기를 바로 확인할 수 있습니다.</div><div class="dictList">${rows.map(p=>{let ex=patternExample(p),tr=patternTranslation(p),g=DB.cards.find(c=>c.id===ENDING_GRAMMAR_MAP[p.id]),tts=g?exampleAudioTarget(g):'';return `<div class="endingEntry"><div class="jpPattern">${escapeHtml(p.pattern)}</div><div class="meaning">${escapeHtml(p.meaning)}</div><div class="connect">만드는 법: ${escapeHtml(p.connect)}</div>${ex?`<div class="example">${escapeHtml(ex)}${tr?`<br><span style="font-family:inherit;color:#64748b">${escapeHtml(tr)}</span>`:''}</div>`:''}${tts?`<button class="miniAudio inline" onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(tts)}')">🔊 예문 듣기</button>`:''}</div>`}).join('')}</div>`
}
function renderGrammarDictionary(){
  let q=dictionaryQuery.trim().toLowerCase(),rows=DB.cards.filter(c=>c.kind==='grammar').filter(c=>!q||[c.jp,c.ko,c.level,c.category,c.note,c.extra?.connect,c.extra?.example,c.extra?.translation].some(x=>String(x||'').toLowerCase().includes(q)));let count=document.getElementById('dictionaryCount');if(count)count.textContent=`${rows.length}개`;
  document.getElementById('dictionaryContent').innerHTML=`<div class="dictList">${rows.map(c=>`<details class="grammarEntry"><summary><div class="entryTitle"><b>${escapeHtml(c.jp)}</b><small>${escapeHtml(c.ko)}</small></div><span class="entryTag">${escapeHtml(c.level||'')} ${escapeHtml(c.category||'')}</span></summary><div class="entryBody">${c.extra?.connect?`<b>만드는 법</b> ${escapeHtml(c.extra.connect)}<br>`:''}${c.extra?.example?`<b>예문</b> ${escapeHtml(c.extra.example)}${c.extra?.translation?`<br><span style="color:#64748b">${escapeHtml(c.extra.translation)}</span>`:''}<br>`:''}${c.note?`<b>포인트</b> ${escapeHtml(c.note)}<br>`:''}<button class="iconbtn" style="margin-top:8px" onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(audioTarget(c))}')">🔊 예문 듣기</button></div></details>`).join('')}</div>`;
}

function practiceItemKey(it){return it.kind==='verb'?`v:${it.verbId}:${it.formKey}`:`e:${it.verbId}:${it.patternId}`}
function makePracticeItem(kind,verb,detail,isReview=false){return kind==='verb'?{kind,verbId:verb.id,formKey:detail,isReview,done:false,hadWrong:false,firstRecorded:false,reviewQueued:false}:{kind,verbId:verb.id,patternId:detail,isReview,done:false,hadWrong:false,firstRecorded:false,reviewQueued:false}}
function buildVerbPractice(count=10){let all=[];for(const v of currentModeVerbs().filter(v=>VERB_FORM_DEFS.filter(f=>validForm(v,f.key)).length>=6)){for(const f of VERB_FORM_DEFS.filter(f=>validForm(v,f.key))){let it=makePracticeItem('verb',v,f.key);all.push([reviewPriority(`practice:verb:${v.id}:${f.key}`),Math.random(),it])}}all.sort((a,b)=>b[0]-a[0]||b[1]-a[1]);return all.slice(0,count).map(x=>x[2])}
function buildEndingPractice(count=10){let all=[];for(const v of currentModeVerbs()){for(const p of ENDING_PATTERNS.filter(p=>endingAnswer(p,v))){let it=makePracticeItem('ending',v,p.id);all.push([reviewPriority(`practice:ending:${v.id}:${p.id}`),Math.random(),it])}}all.sort((a,b)=>b[0]-a[0]||b[1]-a[1]);return all.slice(0,count).map(x=>x[2])}
function startVerbDrill(){startPractice('verb')}
function startEndingDrill(){startPractice('ending')}
function startPractice(kind){
  if(state.practiceSession&&state.practiceSession.items?.length&&!confirm('진행 중인 활용 훈련이 있습니다. 새 훈련을 시작할까요?'))return;
  let items=kind==='verb'?buildVerbPractice(10):buildEndingPractice(10);if(!items.length){toast('현재 모드에서 연습할 동사를 찾지 못했습니다.');return}practiceSession={version:1,kind,items,idx:0,baseCount:items.length,firstTotal:0,firstCorrect:0,reviewAdded:0};state.practiceSession=practiceSession;saveState();showView('practiceView');renderPracticeItem();
}
function resumePractice(){let ps=state.practiceSession;if(!ps||!Array.isArray(ps.items)||!ps.items.length){toast('이어갈 활용 훈련이 없습니다.');updatePracticeHome();return}practiceSession=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(ps));showView('practiceView');renderPracticeItem()}
function savePracticeSession(){if(!practiceSession)return;state.practiceSession=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(practiceSession));saveState();updatePracticeHome()}
function exitPractice(){if(practiceSession){savePracticeSession();toast('활용 훈련 위치를 저장했습니다.')}goHome()}
function practiceCurrent(){return practiceSession?.items?.[practiceSession.idx]}
function practiceVerb(it){return DB.cards.find(c=>c.id===it?.verbId)}
function practicePattern(it){return ENDING_PATTERNS.find(p=>p.id===it?.patternId)}
function practiceCorrect(it){let v=practiceVerb(it);return it.kind==='verb'?validForm(v,it.formKey):endingAnswer(practicePattern(it),v)}
function practiceLabel(it){if(it.kind==='verb')return VERB_FORM_DEFS.find(f=>f.key===it.formKey)?.label||it.formKey;return practicePattern(it)?.meaning||''}
function primaryKoMeaning(v){
  let s=String(v?.ko||'').replace(/\([^)]*\)/g,'').trim();
  s=s.split(/[，,·]/)[0].trim();
  return s||String(v?.ko||'').trim();
}
function koVerbStem(v){let s=primaryKoMeaning(v);return s.endsWith('다')?s.slice(0,-1):s}
function verbFormMeaning(v,key){
  const base=primaryKoMeaning(v),stem=koVerbStem(v);
  switch(key){
    case 'ます': return `“${base}”를 정중하게 말함 (~합니다/~습니다)`;
    case 'て': return `“${base}” 뒤에 말을 이어 붙임 (~하고/~해서)`;
    case 'た': return `“${base}”의 과거·완료 (~했다)`;
    case 'ない': return stem?`${stem}지 않다`:`“${base}”의 부정 (~하지 않다)`;
    case '가능': return `“${base}” → ~할 수 있다`;
    case '의지': return stem?`${stem}자 / ${stem}려고 하다`:`“${base}” → ~하자 / ~하려고 하다`;
    case 'ば': return `“${base}” → ~하면 / ~라면`;
    case '수동': return `“${base}” → ~되다 / ~당하다 (문맥에 따라)`;
    case '사역': return stem?`${stem}게 하다`:`“${base}” → ~하게 하다`;
    default: return base;
  }
}
function practiceMeaning(it){let v=practiceVerb(it);if(it.kind==='verb')return verbFormMeaning(v,it.formKey);return practicePattern(it)?.meaning||''}
function practiceConnection(it){if(it.kind==='verb')return VERB_FORM_DEFS.find(f=>f.key===it.formKey)?.hint||'';return practicePattern(it)?.connect||''}
function practiceChoices(it){let v=practiceVerb(it),correct=practiceCorrect(it),vals=[];if(it.kind==='verb'){vals=VERB_FORM_DEFS.map(f=>validForm(v,f.key)).filter(Boolean)}else vals=ENDING_PATTERNS.map(p=>endingAnswer(p,v)).filter(Boolean);let uniq=[...new Set(vals.filter(x=>x!==correct))];return shuffle([correct,...shuffle(uniq).slice(0,3)])}
function renderPracticeItem(){
  if(!practiceSession)return;if(practiceSession.idx<0)practiceSession.idx=0;if(practiceSession.idx>=practiceSession.items.length){finishPractice();return}let it=practiceCurrent(),v=practiceVerb(it);if(!v){practiceSession.idx++;renderPracticeItem();return}
  let baseDone=practiceSession.items.filter(x=>!x.isReview&&x.done).length,reviewTotal=practiceSession.items.filter(x=>x.isReview).length,reviewDone=practiceSession.items.filter(x=>x.isReview&&x.done).length;document.getElementById('practiceCount').textContent=`기본 ${baseDone}/${practiceSession.baseCount}${reviewTotal?` +복습 ${reviewDone}/${reviewTotal}`:''}`;document.getElementById('practiceProgress').style.width=(baseDone/Math.max(1,practiceSession.baseCount)*100)+'%';document.getElementById('practicePrev').disabled=practiceSession.idx<=0;document.getElementById('practiceNext').textContent=practiceSession.idx>=practiceSession.items.length-1?'완료 →':'다음 →';document.getElementById('practiceNotice').textContent=reviewTotal?`🔁 오답·반복 문제 ${reviewDone}/${reviewTotal}`:'';
  let card=document.getElementById('practiceCard'),correct=practiceCorrect(it);if(it.done){card.innerHTML=`<span class="badge">✓ 완료 · ${it.kind==='verb'?'동사 변형':'문장 완성'}${it.isReview?' · 🔁 재복습':''}</span><div class="prompt"><div class="practiceVerb">${escapeHtml(v.jp)}</div><div class="practiceKo">${escapeHtml(v.reading||'')} · ${escapeHtml(v.ko)}</div><div class="practiceTarget">${escapeHtml(practiceLabel(it))}</div><div style="margin:7px auto 4px;max-width:650px;color:#1e40af;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.45">뜻: ${escapeHtml(practiceMeaning(it))}</div><div class="jp" style="font-size:29px">${escapeHtml(correct)}</div><div class="practiceExplain">${escapeHtml(practiceConnection(it))}</div></div><div class="actions"><button class="bigbtn light" onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(practiceAudioTarget(it))}')">🔊 듣기</button><button class="bigbtn ghost" onclick="practiceRepeatCurrent()">🔁 뒤에서 다시</button></div>`;return}
  let choices=practiceChoices(it);card.innerHTML=`<span class="badge">${it.kind==='verb'?'🔄 동사 변형':'🧩 문장 완성'}${it.isReview?' · 🔁 재복습':''}</span><div class="prompt"><div class="hint">${it.kind==='verb'?'기본형을 보고 요청한 활용형을 고르세요.':'다음 뜻이 되도록 가장 알맞은 문장을 고르세요.'}${it.hadWrong?' 이번에는 정확히 맞혀보세요.':''}</div><div class="practiceVerb">${escapeHtml(v.jp)}</div><div class="practiceKo">${escapeHtml(v.ko)} · ${escapeHtml(v.category||'')}</div><div class="practiceTarget">${escapeHtml(practiceLabel(it))}</div><div style="margin:7px auto 12px;max-width:650px;color:#1e40af;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.45">뜻: ${escapeHtml(practiceMeaning(it))}</div><div class="practiceChoices">${choices.map(x=>`<button class="practiceChoice" data-answer="${escapeHtml(x)}" onclick="answerPractice(this)">${escapeHtml(x)}</button>`).join('')}</div><div id="practiceResult" class="practiceResult"></div></div><div class="actions"><button class="bigbtn light" onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(verbBaseAudio(v))}')">🔊 기본형 듣기</button></div>`;
}
function recordPracticeFirst(it,ok){if(it.firstRecorded)return;it.firstRecorded=true;if(it.isReview)return;practiceSession.firstTotal++;let st=practiceStats(practiceSession.kind);st.firstTotal++;if(ok){practiceSession.firstCorrect++;st.firstCorrect++}}
function queuePracticeReview(it,reason='오답 복습',manual=false){if(!practiceSession||!it)return false;let key=practiceItemKey(it),future=practiceSession.items.slice(practiceSession.idx+1).some(x=>!x.done&&practiceItemKey(x)===key);if(future)return false;let clone=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(it));clone.isReview=true;clone.done=false;clone.hadWrong=false;clone.firstRecorded=false;clone.reviewQueued=false;clone.reviewReason=reason;practiceSession.items.push(clone);practiceSession.reviewAdded++;it.reviewQueued=true;savePracticeSession();return true}
function practiceReviewKey(it){return it.kind==='verb'?`practice:verb:${it.verbId}:${it.formKey}`:`practice:ending:${it.verbId}:${it.patternId}`}
function answerPractice(btn){let it=practiceCurrent();if(!it||it.done)return;let selected=btn.dataset.answer||'',correct=practiceCorrect(it),ok=selected===correct;recordPracticeFirst(it,ok);document.querySelectorAll('.practiceChoice').forEach(b=>{b.disabled=true;if(b.dataset.answer===correct)b.classList.add('correct');else if(b===btn)b.classList.add('wrong')});let result=document.getElementById('practiceResult'),audio=practiceAudioTarget(it);if(ok){it.done=true;practiceStats(practiceSession.kind).completed++;scheduleGenericReview(practiceReviewKey(it),null,true);if(state.autoSpeak)speak(audio);result.innerHTML=`<div class="practiceExplain"><b>${escapeHtml(correct)}</b><br>${escapeHtml(practiceConnection(it))}</div>${reviewScheduleButtonsGeneric(practiceReviewKey(it))}<div style="text-align:center;margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap"><button class="bigbtn ghost" onclick="practiceRepeatCurrent()">🔁 뒤에서 다시</button><button class="bigbtn blue" onclick="practiceAdvance()">다음 문제 →</button></div>`}else{it.hadWrong=true;queuePracticeReview(it,'오답 재복습');result.innerHTML=`<div class="practiceExplain" style="background:#fff7ed;color:#9a3412">정답은 <b>${escapeHtml(correct)}</b> 입니다.<br>${escapeHtml(practiceConnection(it))}<br><small>지금 다시 맞히고, 수업 뒤쪽에서 한 번 더 나옵니다.</small></div><div style="text-align:center;margin-top:10px"><button class="bigbtn blue" onclick="retryPracticeNow()">↻ 같은 문제 다시 풀기</button></div>`;if(state.autoSpeak)speak(audio)}savePracticeSession()}
function retryPracticeNow(){renderPracticeItem()}
function practiceAdvance(){if(!practiceSession)return;practiceSession.idx++;savePracticeSession();renderPracticeItem()}
function practicePrevious(){if(!practiceSession||practiceSession.idx<=0)return;practiceSession.idx--;savePracticeSession();renderPracticeItem()}
function practiceNextNav(){if(!practiceSession)return;let it=practiceCurrent();if(it&&!it.done){recordPracticeFirst(it,false);it.hadWrong=true;queuePracticeReview(it,'건너뜀 복습');it.done=true;toast('건너뛴 문제는 뒤쪽에 다시 나옵니다.')}practiceSession.idx++;savePracticeSession();renderPracticeItem()}
function practiceRepeatCurrent(){let it=practiceCurrent();if(!it)return;let added=queuePracticeReview(it,'수동 반복',true);toast(added?'수업 뒤쪽에 다시 넣었습니다.':'이미 뒤쪽에 같은 문제가 있습니다.');renderPracticeItem()}
function finishPractice(){
  let ps=practiceSession;if(!ps)return;let pending=ps.items.findIndex(x=>!x.done);if(pending>=0){ps.idx=pending;renderPracticeItem();return}let kind=ps.kind,st=practiceStats(kind);st.sessions++;touchStudyDay(kind==='verb'?'verb':'ending');let firstAcc=ps.firstTotal?Math.round(ps.firstCorrect/ps.firstTotal*100):0,total=ps.items.length,review=ps.items.filter(x=>x.isReview).length;state.practiceSession=null;practiceSession=null;saveState();updatePracticeHome();let card=document.getElementById('practiceCard');document.getElementById('practiceProgress').style.width='100%';document.getElementById('practiceCount').textContent='완료';document.getElementById('practiceNotice').textContent='';document.getElementById('practicePrev').disabled=true;document.getElementById('practiceNext').disabled=true;card.innerHTML=`<div class="summary"><div class="trophy">🎯</div><h2>${kind==='verb'?'동사 변형':'문장 완성'} 훈련 완료!</h2><p>틀렸던 문제까지 다시 맞혔습니다.</p><div class="summaryGrid"><div><b>${ps.baseCount}</b><span>기본 문제</span></div><div><b>${firstAcc}%</b><span>첫 시도 정확도</span></div><div><b>${review}</b><span>추가 복습</span></div><div><b>${total}</b><span>총 풀이</span></div></div><button class="bigbtn blue" onclick="${kind==='verb'?'startVerbDrill()':'startEndingDrill()'}">10문제 더</button> <button class="bigbtn light" onclick="goHome()">홈으로</button></div>`;
}

if('serviceWorker' in navigator){window.addEventListener('load',()=>navigator.serviceWorker.register('./service-worker.js').then(reg=>{reg.update().catch(()=>{});reg.addEventListener('updatefound',()=>{let w=reg.installing;if(w)w.addEventListener('statechange',()=>{if(w.state==='installed'&&navigator.serviceWorker.controller)toast('새 버전이 준비되었습니다. 앱을 다시 열면 적용됩니다.')})})}).catch(()=>{}));}
window.addEventListener('pagehide',()=>{if(lesson)saveLessonState()});
document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{if(document.visibilityState==='hidden'&&lesson)saveLessonState()});

// ---------- 실생활 일본어 v6.1 ----------
let lifeTab='vocab',lifeQuery='',lifeCategory='전체',lifeVocabLimit=100,lifeSession=null;
const LIFE_LABEL={vocab:'생활용어',particle:'조사 표현',connector:'접속사',location:'위치 표현',number:'날짜·숫자',situation:'상황 연계'};
function lifeStat(kind){state.lifeDrills=state.lifeDrills||{};return state.lifeDrills[kind]||(state.lifeDrills[kind]={sessions:0,firstCorrect:0,firstTotal:0})}
function updateLifeHome(){let b=document.getElementById('lifeResumeBtn');if(b)b.classList.toggle('hidden',!state.lifeSession);let n=document.getElementById('lifeSessionsN');if(n)n.textContent=Object.values(state.lifeDrills||{}).reduce((a,x)=>a+Number(x?.sessions||0),0)}
function openLifeHub(tab='vocab'){lifeTab=tab;lifeQuery='';lifeCategory='전체';lifeVocabLimit=100;showView('lifeView');renderLifeHub()}
function setLifeTab(tab){lifeTab=tab;lifeQuery='';lifeCategory='전체';lifeVocabLimit=100;renderLifeHub()}
function lifeTabsHtml(){return `<div class="lifeTabs">${[['vocab','🧺 생활용어'],['particle','🔗 조사'],['connector','↔️ 접속사'],['location','📍 위치'],['number','🗓 날짜·숫자'],['situation','🎬 상황연계']].map(([k,t])=>`<button class="${lifeTab===k?'on':''}" onclick="setLifeTab('${k}')">${t}</button>`).join('')}</div>`}
function renderLifeHub(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-lifetab]').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('on',x.dataset.lifetab===lifeTab));let c=document.getElementById('lifeContent');if(!c)return;if(lifeTab==='vocab')renderLifeVocab(c);else if(lifeTab==='particle')renderParticles(c);else if(lifeTab==='connector')renderConnectors(c);else if(lifeTab==='location')renderLocations(c);else if(lifeTab==='number')renderNumbers(c);else renderSituations(c)}
function setLifeCategory(cat){lifeCategory=cat;lifeVocabLimit=100;renderLifeVocabList()}
function lifeVocabReading(jp){let x=LIFE_VOCAB.find(v=>v.jp===jp);return x?.reading||jp}
function scenePhraseAudio(jp){
  let plain=plainJP(jp),match=DB.cards.find(c=>plainJP(c.jp)===plain);if(match)return wordAudioTarget(match);
  return speechJP(jp)
}
function renderLifeVocab(c){let cats=['전체',...new Set(LIFE_VOCAB.map(x=>x.category))];c.innerHTML=`<div class="lifeIntro"><div><b>🧺 생활용어 ${LIFE_VOCAB.length}개</b><span>JLPT 급수와 관계없이 실제 생활에서 자주 듣고 쓰는 단어를 계속 확장할 수 있는 공간입니다.</span></div><button class="bigbtn blue" onclick="startLifeQuiz('vocab')">10문제 연습</button></div><input id="lifeSearch" class="dictSearch" placeholder="일본어·읽기·한국어 검색" oninput="lifeQuery=this.value;lifeVocabLimit=100;renderLifeVocabList()"><div class="lifeCats">${cats.map(x=>`<button class="${x===lifeCategory?'on':''}" onclick="setLifeCategory('${x}')">${x}</button>`).join('')}</div><div id="lifeVocabList"></div>`;renderLifeVocabList()}
function renderLifeVocabList(){let box=document.getElementById('lifeVocabList');if(!box)return;let q=(lifeQuery||'').trim().toLowerCase(),rows=LIFE_VOCAB.filter(x=>(lifeCategory==='전체'||x.category===lifeCategory)&&(!q||`${x.jp} ${x.reading} ${x.ko}`.toLowerCase().includes(q)));let show=rows.slice(0,lifeVocabLimit);box.innerHTML=`<div class="lifeCount">${rows.length}개 표현 · 카드를 누르면 표시된 읽기 그대로 재생됩니다.</div><div class="lifeWordGrid">${show.map(x=>`<button class="lifeWord" onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(x.reading||x.jp)}')"><b>${escapeHtml(x.jp)}</b><small>🔊 ${escapeHtml(x.reading)}</small><span>${escapeHtml(x.ko)}</span><em>${escapeHtml(x.category)}</em></button>`).join('')}</div>${rows.length>lifeVocabLimit?`<button class="bigbtn light" style="width:100%;margin-top:12px" onclick="lifeVocabLimit+=100;renderLifeVocabList()">100개 더 보기</button>`:''}`}
function renderParticles(c){c.innerHTML=`<div class="lifeIntro"><div><b>🔗 조사 표현</b><span>は·が·を·に·で·と 같은 조사를 ‘뜻’보다 실제 쓰임으로 구분합니다.</span></div><button class="bigbtn blue" onclick="startLifeQuiz('particle')">10문제 연습</button></div><div class="particleGrid">${PARTICLE_DATA.map(x=>`<div class="particleCard"><div class="particleBig">${escapeHtml(x.p)}</div><div><b>${escapeHtml(x.ko)}</b><p>${escapeHtml(x.use)}</p><button onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(x.ex)}')">🔊 ${escapeHtml(x.ex)}</button><small>${escapeHtml(x.tr)}</small></div></div>`).join('')}</div>`}
function renderConnectors(c){let rows=window.CONNECTOR_DATA||[];c.innerHTML=`<div class="lifeIntro"><div><b>↔️ 접속사 표현 ${rows.length}개</b><span>그리고·그래서·그러나·그런데·즉·한편처럼 문장을 자연스럽게 이어 주는 표현을 익힙니다.</span></div><button class="bigbtn blue" onclick="startLifeQuiz('connector')">10문제 연습</button></div><div class="connectorGrid">${rows.map(x=>`<div class="connectorCard"><div class="connectorTop"><b>${escapeHtml(x.jp)}</b><span>${escapeHtml(x.ko)}</span></div><p>${escapeHtml(x.use)}</p><button class="connectorExample" onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(x.exampleReading||x.example)}')"><b>${escapeHtml(x.example)}</b><small>${escapeHtml(x.tr)}</small><em>🔊 예문 듣기</em></button></div>`).join('')}</div>`}

function locationSvg(id){let ball=`<circle cx="110" cy="88" r="15" fill="#2563eb"/><text x="110" y="94" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="white">●</text>`,box=`<rect x="78" y="58" width="64" height="60" rx="8" fill="#e2e8f0" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2"/><text x="110" y="94" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20">📦</text>`;
 const pos={above:[110,26],below:[110,152],left:[34,88],right:[186,88],near:[158,88],beside:[158,88],diagonal:[165,34],nearfront:[55,136],backdeep:[166,36]};
 if(id==='inside')return `<svg viewBox="0 0 220 180">${box}<circle cx="110" cy="88" r="11" fill="#2563eb"/></svg>`;
 if(id==='between')return `<svg viewBox="0 0 220 180"><rect x="35" y="58" width="55" height="60" rx="8" fill="#e2e8f0"/><rect x="130" y="58" width="55" height="60" rx="8" fill="#e2e8f0"/><circle cx="110" cy="88" r="14" fill="#2563eb"/></svg>`;
 if(id==='opposite')return `<svg viewBox="0 0 220 180"><rect x="35" y="58" width="55" height="60" rx="8" fill="#e2e8f0"/><circle cx="165" cy="88" r="14" fill="#2563eb"/><path d="M95 88h50" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/></svg>`;
 if(id==='outside')return `<svg viewBox="0 0 220 180">${box}<circle cx="185" cy="35" r="14" fill="#2563eb"/><path d="M75 48h72v80H75z" fill="none" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/></svg>`;
 if(id==='front')return `<svg viewBox="0 0 220 180"><circle cx="110" cy="116" r="18" fill="#2563eb"/>${box.replace('fill="#e2e8f0"','fill="#cbd5e1"')}</svg>`;
 if(id==='behind')return `<svg viewBox="0 0 220 180"><circle cx="110" cy="62" r="18" fill="#2563eb"/>${box}</svg>`;
 let p=pos[id]||[110,26];return `<svg viewBox="0 0 220 180">${box}<circle cx="${p[0]}" cy="${p[1]}" r="14" fill="#2563eb"/>${id==='backdeep'?'<path d="M110 88L166 36" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/>':''}</svg>`}
function renderLocations(c){c.innerHTML=`<div class="lifeIntro"><div><b>📍 위치 표현</b><span>그림과 한자를 보고, 음성은 표시된 히라가나 읽기를 정확히 재생합니다.</span></div><button class="bigbtn blue" onclick="startLifeQuiz('location')">그림 10문제</button></div><div class="locationGrid">${LOCATION_DATA.map(x=>`<button class="locationCard" onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(x.reading)}')"><div class="locationPic">${locationSvg(x.id)}</div><b>${x.jp} <small>${x.reading}</small></b><span>${x.ko}</span><em>🔊 ${x.desc}</em></button>`).join('')}</div>`}
function renderNumbers(c){
  let tile=x=>`<button class="numTile" onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(x[2])}')"><b>${escapeHtml(x[0])}</b><span>${escapeHtml(x[1])}</span><small>🔊 ${escapeHtml(x[2])}</small></button>`;
  let month=MONTH_DATA.map(tile).join(''),week=WEEKDAY_DATA.map(tile).join(''),days=DAY_DATA.map(tile).join(''),rel=RELATIVE_DATE_DATA.map(tile).join('');
  let money=NUMBER_ITEMS.filter(x=>x.kind==='money').map(x=>`<button class="numTile" onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(x.answer)}')"><b>${escapeHtml(x.prompt)}</b><span>${escapeHtml(x.jp)}</span><small>🔊 ${escapeHtml(x.answer)}</small></button>`).join('');
  let time=NUMBER_ITEMS.filter(x=>x.kind==='time'||x.kind==='minute').map(x=>`<button class="numTile" onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(x.answer)}')"><b>${escapeHtml(x.prompt)}</b><span>${escapeHtml(x.jp)}</span><small>🔊 ${escapeHtml(x.answer)}</small></button>`).join('');
  let cnt=COUNTER_DATA.map(x=>`<details class="counterCard"><summary><b>${x.name}</b><span>${x.counter}</span></summary><div>${x.examples.map(e=>`<button onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(e[2])}')"><b>${e[0]}</b><span>${e[1]}</span><small>🔊 ${e[2]}</small></button>`).join('')}</div></details>`).join('');
  c.innerHTML=`<div class="lifeIntro"><div><b>🗓 날짜 · 숫자 · 조수사</b><span>표기보다 읽기가 중요한 영역이라 모든 카드가 히라가나 읽기를 직접 재생합니다.</span></div><button class="bigbtn blue" onclick="startLifeQuiz('number')">10문제 연습</button></div><h3 class="lifeSub">월</h3><div class="numGrid">${month}</div><h3 class="lifeSub">요일</h3><div class="numGrid">${week}</div><h3 class="lifeSub">상대 날짜</h3><div class="numGrid">${rel}</div><h3 class="lifeSub">날짜 읽기</h3><div class="dayGrid">${days}</div><h3 class="lifeSub">시간 · 분</h3><div class="numGrid">${time}</div><h3 class="lifeSub">금액</h3><div class="numGrid">${money}</div><h3 class="lifeSub">조수사</h3><div class="counterGrid">${cnt}</div>`
}
function renderSituations(c){c.innerHTML=`<div class="lifeIntro"><div><b>🎬 상황별 연계 연습</b><span>한 장소에서 함께 쓰는 단어와 문장을 묶습니다. 단어 칩도 눌러서 바로 읽기를 들을 수 있습니다.</span></div><button class="bigbtn blue" onclick="startLifeQuiz('situation')">랜덤 10문제</button></div><div class="sceneGrid">${LIFE_SCENES.map(s=>`<div class="sceneCard"><div class="sceneHead"><span>${s.icon}</span><div><b>${s.name}</b><small>${s.goal}</small></div></div><div class="sceneVocab">${s.vocab.map(v=>`<button onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(lifeVocabReading(v))}')">${escapeHtml(v)}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="scenePhrases">${s.phrases.slice(0,3).map(p=>`<button onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(scenePhraseAudio(p[0]))}')"><b>${escapeHtml(p[0])}</b><small>${escapeHtml(p[1])}</small></button>`).join('')}</div><button class="bigbtn light" style="width:100%" onclick="startLifeQuiz('situation','${s.id}')">${s.name} 5문제</button></div>`).join('')}</div>`}
function choicePool(answer,pool,count=4){let a=[answer,...shuffle([...new Set(pool.filter(x=>x&&x!==answer))]).slice(0,count-1)];return shuffle(a)}
function makeLifeItems(kind,count=10,sceneId=''){let items=[];
 if(kind==='vocab'){let alljp=LIFE_VOCAB.map(x=>x.jp);items=LIFE_VOCAB.map((x,i)=>({id:`v-${x.id}-${i}`,reviewKey:`life:vocab:${x.id}`,kind,prompt:x.ko,sub:`${x.category}`,answer:x.jp,choices:choicePool(x.jp,alljp),explain:`${x.jp} (${x.reading}) = ${x.ko}`,tts:x.reading||x.jp}))}
 else if(kind==='particle'){let all=PARTICLE_DATA.map(x=>x.p);items=PARTICLE_QUESTIONS.map((x,i)=>({id:`p-${i}-${Date.now()}`,reviewKey:`life:particle:${encodeURIComponent(x.s+'|'+x.a)}`,kind,prompt:x.s.replace('__','□'),sub:x.ko,answer:x.a,choices:choicePool(x.a,all),explain:(PARTICLE_DATA.find(p=>p.p===x.a)?.ko||x.a),tts:x.s.replace('__',x.a)}))}
 else if(kind==='connector'){let rows=window.CONNECTOR_DATA||[],all=rows.map(x=>x.jp);items=rows.map((x,i)=>({id:`c-${x.id}-${i}`,reviewKey:`life:connector:${x.id}`,kind,prompt:x.ko,sub:x.use,answer:x.jp,choices:choicePool(x.jp,all),explain:`${x.jp} (${x.reading}) · ${x.ko}`,tts:x.reading||x.jp,example:x.example,exampleReading:x.exampleReading,tr:x.tr}))}
 else if(kind==='location'){let all=LOCATION_DATA.map(x=>x.jp);items=LOCATION_DATA.map((x,i)=>({id:`l-${x.id}-${i}`,reviewKey:`life:location:${x.id}`,kind,prompt:'파란 점의 위치는?',sub:'그림을 보고 알맞은 위치 표현을 고르세요.',answer:x.jp,choices:choicePool(x.jp,all),explain:`${x.jp} (${x.reading}) · ${x.ko}`,tts:x.reading,visual:locationSvg(x.id)}))}
 else if(kind==='number'){let all=NUMBER_ITEMS.map(x=>x.answer);items=NUMBER_ITEMS.map((x,i)=>({id:`n-${i}-${Date.now()}`,reviewKey:`life:number:${encodeURIComponent(x.prompt+'|'+x.answer)}`,kind,prompt:x.prompt,sub:`${x.jp}${x.note?' · '+x.note:''}`,answer:x.answer,choices:choicePool(x.answer,all),explain:`${x.jp} → ${x.answer}`,tts:x.answer}))}
 else {let scenes=sceneId?LIFE_SCENES.filter(s=>s.id===sceneId):LIFE_SCENES,phr=[];scenes.forEach(s=>s.phrases.forEach(p=>phr.push({scene:s.name,icon:s.icon,jp:p[0],ko:p[1]})));let all=LIFE_SCENES.flatMap(s=>s.phrases.map(p=>p[0]));items=phr.map((x,i)=>({id:`s-${sceneId||'all'}-${i}-${Date.now()}`,reviewKey:`life:situation:${encodeURIComponent(x.scene+'|'+x.jp)}`,kind,prompt:x.ko,sub:`${x.icon} ${x.scene}에서 실제로 말해보세요`,answer:x.jp,choices:choicePool(x.jp,all),explain:`${x.jp} = ${x.ko}`,tts:scenePhraseAudio(x.jp)}))}
 items=items.map(x=>({...x,status:'todo',isReview:false,firstAnswered:false,hadWrong:false}));items.sort((a,b)=>reviewPriority(b.reviewKey)-reviewPriority(a.reviewKey));return items.slice(0,sceneId?Math.min(5,items.length):count)
}
function startLifeQuiz(kind,sceneId=''){let items=makeLifeItems(kind,sceneId?5:10,sceneId);lifeSession={kind,sceneId,items,idx:0,baseCount:items.length,firstCorrect:0,firstTotal:0,startedAt:Date.now()};state.lifeSession=lifeSession;saveState();showView('lifeQuizView');renderLifeQuiz()}
function resumeLifePractice(){if(!state.lifeSession)return;lifeSession=state.lifeSession;showView('lifeQuizView');renderLifeQuiz()}
function saveLifeSession(){if(lifeSession){state.lifeSession=lifeSession;saveState()}}
function exitLifeQuiz(){saveLifeSession();goHome()}
function lifeCurrent(){return lifeSession?.items?.[lifeSession.idx]||null}
function lifeProgress(){if(!lifeSession)return {done:0,base:0,review:0};return {done:lifeSession.items.filter(x=>x.status==='done'&&!x.isReview).length,base:lifeSession.baseCount,review:lifeSession.items.filter(x=>x.isReview&&x.status!=='done').length}}
function renderLifeQuiz(){let it=lifeCurrent();if(!it){finishLifeQuiz();return}let p=lifeProgress(),bar=Math.round((p.done/p.base)*100);document.getElementById('lifeProgress').style.width=bar+'%';document.getElementById('lifeCount').textContent=`${Math.min(p.done+1,p.base)}/${p.base}${p.review?' +복습 '+p.review:''}`;document.getElementById('lifePrev').disabled=lifeSession.idx<=0;document.getElementById('lifeNotice').textContent=it.isReview?'🔁 틀렸거나 다시 요청한 문제입니다.':'';let card=document.getElementById('lifeQuizCard');card.innerHTML=`<span class="badge">${LIFE_LABEL[it.kind]}</span><div class="prompt lifePrompt">${it.visual?`<div class="quizVisual">${it.visual}</div>`:''}<div class="hint">${escapeHtml(it.sub||'가장 알맞은 답을 고르세요.')}</div><div class="ko">${escapeHtml(it.prompt)}</div><div class="lifeChoices">${it.choices.map(c=>`<button class="choice" onclick="answerLifeChoice(this,'${encodeURIComponent(c)}')">${escapeHtml(c)}</button>`).join('')}</div><div id="lifeAnswerResult"></div></div><div class="actions"><span class="footerNote" style="margin:0">정답을 고르면 읽기와 음성이 열립니다.</span></div>`}
function answerLifeChoice(btn,enc){let it=lifeCurrent();if(!it||it.status==='done')return;let ans=decodeURIComponent(enc),ok=ans===it.answer,box=document.getElementById('lifeAnswerResult');document.querySelectorAll('#lifeQuizCard .choice').forEach(b=>{b.disabled=true;if(b.textContent===it.answer)b.classList.add('correct')});if(!it.firstAnswered){it.firstAnswered=true;lifeSession.firstTotal++;if(ok)lifeSession.firstCorrect++}if(!ok){btn.classList.add('wrong');it.hadWrong=true;if(!lifeSession.items.some(x=>x.isReview&&x.reviewOf===it.id&&x.status!=='done'))lifeSession.items.push({...it,id:it.id+'-r-'+Date.now(),status:'todo',isReview:true,reviewOf:it.id,firstAnswered:true});box.innerHTML=`<div class="retryBox">정답은 <b>${escapeHtml(it.answer)}</b>입니다.<br>${escapeHtml(it.explain||'')}<br><div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px"><button class="bigbtn light" onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(it.tts||it.answer)}')">🔊 정답 듣기</button><button class="bigbtn light" onclick="retryLifeItem()">↻ 같은 문제 다시 풀기</button></div></div>`;saveLifeSession();return}it.status='done';scheduleGenericReview(it.reviewKey||`life:${it.kind}:${it.reviewOf||it.id}`,null,true);box.innerHTML=`<div class="practiceExplain">✅ ${escapeHtml(it.explain||it.answer)}${it.example?`<br><br><b>${escapeHtml(it.example)}</b><br><span style="color:#64748b">${escapeHtml(it.tr||'')}</span>`:''}<br><button class="bigbtn light" style="margin-top:8px" onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(it.tts||it.answer)}')">🔊 정답 듣기</button>${it.example?`<button class="bigbtn light" style="margin-top:8px;margin-left:6px" onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(it.exampleReading||it.example)}')">🔊 예문 듣기</button>`:''}</div>${reviewScheduleButtonsGeneric(it.reviewKey||`life:${it.kind}:${it.reviewOf||it.id}`)}<div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin-top:10px"><button class="bigbtn ghost" onclick="lifeRepeatCurrent()">🔁 뒤에서 다시</button><button class="bigbtn blue" onclick="advanceLifeItem()">다음 문제 →</button></div>`;if(state.autoSpeak)speak(it.tts||it.answer);saveLifeSession()}
function retryLifeItem(){let it=lifeCurrent();if(!it)return;it.status='todo';renderLifeQuiz()}
function advanceLifeItem(){if(!lifeSession)return;let next=lifeSession.items.findIndex((x,i)=>i>lifeSession.idx&&x.status!=='done');if(next<0)next=lifeSession.items.findIndex(x=>x.status!=='done');if(next<0){finishLifeQuiz();return}lifeSession.idx=next;saveLifeSession();renderLifeQuiz()}
function lifePrevious(){if(!lifeSession||lifeSession.idx<=0)return;lifeSession.idx--;saveLifeSession();renderLifeQuiz()}
function lifeNextNav(){let it=lifeCurrent();if(!it)return;if(it.status!=='done'&&!lifeSession.items.some(x=>x.isReview&&x.reviewOf===it.id&&x.status!=='done'))lifeSession.items.push({...it,id:it.id+'-skip-'+Date.now(),status:'todo',isReview:true,reviewOf:it.id,firstAnswered:true});let n=Math.min(lifeSession.items.length-1,lifeSession.idx+1);lifeSession.idx=n;saveLifeSession();renderLifeQuiz()}
function lifeRepeatCurrent(){let it=lifeCurrent();if(!it)return;if(!lifeSession.items.some(x=>x.isReview&&x.reviewOf===(it.reviewOf||it.id)&&x.status!=='done'))lifeSession.items.push({...it,id:it.id+'-manual-'+Date.now(),status:'todo',isReview:true,reviewOf:it.reviewOf||it.id,firstAnswered:true});toast('뒤쪽 복습에 추가했습니다.');saveLifeSession();renderLifeQuiz()}
function finishLifeQuiz(){if(!lifeSession)return;let pending=lifeSession.items.findIndex(x=>x.status!=='done');if(pending>=0){lifeSession.idx=pending;renderLifeQuiz();return}let s=lifeStat(lifeSession.kind);s.sessions++;s.firstCorrect+=lifeSession.firstCorrect;s.firstTotal+=lifeSession.firstTotal;let acc=lifeSession.firstTotal?Math.round(lifeSession.firstCorrect/lifeSession.firstTotal*100):0,review=lifeSession.items.filter(x=>x.isReview).length,base=lifeSession.baseCount,kind=lifeSession.kind;touchStudyDay('life');state.lifeSession=null;lifeSession=null;saveState();updateHome();let card=document.getElementById('lifeQuizCard');document.getElementById('lifeProgress').style.width='100%';document.getElementById('lifeCount').textContent='완료';document.getElementById('lifeNotice').textContent='';card.innerHTML=`<div class="summary"><div class="trophy">🌟</div><h2>${LIFE_LABEL[kind]} 완료!</h2><p>실생활에서 바로 꺼낼 수 있는 표현을 한 세트 더 익혔습니다.</p><div class="summaryGrid"><div><b>${base}</b><span>기본 문제</span></div><div><b>${acc}%</b><span>첫 시도 정확도</span></div><div><b>${review}</b><span>추가 복습</span></div><div><b>+12</b><span>랭킹 점수</span></div></div><button class="bigbtn blue" onclick="startLifeQuiz('${kind}')">한 세트 더</button> <button class="bigbtn light" onclick="openLifeHub('${kind}')">내용 보기</button></div>`}


function updateJlptHome(){let b=document.getElementById('jlptResumeBtn');if(b)b.classList.toggle('hidden',!state.jlptSession)}
// ---------- JLPT 단어 N5~N1 v6.5 ----------
let jlptLevel='N5',jlptQuery='',jlptLimit=120,jlptSession=null;
function jlptData(level=jlptLevel){return (window.JLPT_WORD_DATA?.[level]||[])}
function openJlptHub(level='N5'){jlptLevel=level;jlptQuery='';jlptLimit=120;showView('jlptView');renderJlptHub()}
function setJlptLevel(level){jlptLevel=level;jlptQuery='';jlptLimit=120;renderJlptHub()}
function jlptStat(level){state.jlptDrills=state.jlptDrills||{};return state.jlptDrills[level]||(state.jlptDrills[level]={sessions:0,firstCorrect:0,firstTotal:0})}
function renderJlptHub(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-jlptlevel]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('on',b.dataset.jlptlevel===jlptLevel));let rows=jlptData(),q=jlptQuery.trim().toLowerCase();let f=rows.filter(x=>!q||[x.jp,x.reading,x.ko,x.tag,...(x.examples||[])].some(v=>String(v||'').toLowerCase().includes(q))),show=f.slice(0,jlptLimit),s=jlptStat(jlptLevel),acc=s.firstTotal?Math.round(s.firstCorrect/s.firstTotal*100):0;let c=document.getElementById('jlptContent');if(!c)return;c.innerHTML=`<div class="lifeIntro"><div><b>🎯 JLPT ${jlptLevel} 단어 ${rows.length.toLocaleString()}개</b><span>업로드 단어 모음을 기준으로 표기·읽기·뜻을 정리했습니다. N5~N3는 기존 앱 데이터와 함께 10분 학습에도 보강됩니다.</span></div><button class="bigbtn blue" onclick="startJlptQuiz('${jlptLevel}')">10문제 연습</button></div><div class="jlptSummary"><span>누적 ${s.sessions||0}세트</span><span>첫 시도 ${s.firstTotal?acc+'%':'-'}</span><span>검색 결과 ${f.length.toLocaleString()}개</span></div><input id="jlptSearch" class="dictSearch" placeholder="${jlptLevel} 일본어·읽기·한국어 검색" value="${escapeHtml(jlptQuery)}" oninput="jlptQuery=this.value;jlptLimit=120;renderJlptHub()"><div class="jlptWordList">${show.map(w=>`<div class="jlptWordCard"><button class="jlptSpeak" onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(w.reading||w.jp)}')">🔊</button><div><b>${escapeHtml(w.jp)}</b><small>${escapeHtml(w.reading||'')}</small><span>${escapeHtml(w.ko)}</span>${w.examples?.[0]?`<p>${escapeHtml(w.examples[0])}</p>`:''}</div></div>`).join('')}</div>${f.length>show.length?`<button class="bigbtn light" style="width:100%;margin-top:12px" onclick="jlptLimit+=120;renderJlptHub()">더 보기 (${show.length}/${f.length})</button>`:''}`}
function makeJlptItems(level,count=10){let rows=jlptData(level),all=rows.map(x=>x.jp),items=rows.map((x,i)=>({id:`jlpt-${level}-${x.id||i}`,reviewKey:`jlpt:${level}:${x.id||i}`,level,prompt:x.ko,answer:x.jp,reading:x.reading||x.jp,choices:choicePool(x.jp,all),examples:x.examples||[],status:'todo',isReview:false,firstAnswered:false,hadWrong:false}));items.sort((a,b)=>reviewPriority(b.reviewKey)-reviewPriority(a.reviewKey));return items.slice(0,count)}
function startJlptQuiz(level=jlptLevel){jlptLevel=level;let items=makeJlptItems(level,10);jlptSession={level,items,idx:0,baseCount:items.length,firstCorrect:0,firstTotal:0,startedAt:Date.now()};state.jlptSession=jlptSession;saveState();showView('jlptQuizView');renderJlptQuiz()}
function resumeJlptPractice(){if(!state.jlptSession)return;jlptSession=state.jlptSession;jlptLevel=jlptSession.level||'N5';showView('jlptQuizView');renderJlptQuiz()}
function saveJlptSession(){if(jlptSession){state.jlptSession=jlptSession;saveState()}}
function exitJlptQuiz(){saveJlptSession();goHome()}
function jlptCurrent(){return jlptSession?.items?.[jlptSession.idx]||null}
function jlptProgress(){if(!jlptSession)return {done:0,base:0,review:0};return {done:jlptSession.items.filter(x=>x.status==='done'&&!x.isReview).length,base:jlptSession.baseCount,review:jlptSession.items.filter(x=>x.isReview&&x.status!=='done').length}}
function renderJlptQuiz(){let it=jlptCurrent();if(!it){finishJlptQuiz();return}let p=jlptProgress(),bar=p.base?Math.round(p.done/p.base*100):0;document.getElementById('jlptProgress').style.width=bar+'%';document.getElementById('jlptCount').textContent=`${Math.min(p.done+1,p.base)}/${p.base}${p.review?' +복습 '+p.review:''}`;document.getElementById('jlptPrev').disabled=jlptSession.idx<=0;document.getElementById('jlptNotice').textContent=it.isReview?'🔁 다시 확인하는 단어입니다.':'';document.getElementById('jlptQuizCard').innerHTML=`<span class="badge">JLPT ${it.level} 단어</span><div class="prompt"><div class="hint">한국어 뜻에 맞는 일본어를 고르세요. 읽기는 정답 후 공개됩니다.</div><div class="ko">${escapeHtml(it.prompt)}</div><div class="lifeChoices">${it.choices.map(c=>`<button class="choice" onclick="answerJlptChoice(this,'${encodeURIComponent(c)}')">${escapeHtml(c)}</button>`).join('')}</div><div id="jlptAnswerResult"></div></div>`}
function answerJlptChoice(btn,enc){let it=jlptCurrent();if(!it||it.status==='done')return;let ans=decodeURIComponent(enc),ok=ans===it.answer,box=document.getElementById('jlptAnswerResult');document.querySelectorAll('#jlptQuizCard .choice').forEach(b=>{b.disabled=true;if(b.textContent===it.answer)b.classList.add('correct')});if(!it.firstAnswered){it.firstAnswered=true;jlptSession.firstTotal++;if(ok)jlptSession.firstCorrect++}if(!ok){btn.classList.add('wrong');it.hadWrong=true;if(!jlptSession.items.some(x=>x.isReview&&x.reviewOf===it.id&&x.status!=='done'))jlptSession.items.push({...it,id:it.id+'-r-'+Date.now(),status:'todo',isReview:true,reviewOf:it.id,firstAnswered:true});box.innerHTML=`<div class="retryBox">정답은 <b>${escapeHtml(it.answer)}</b> (${escapeHtml(it.reading)}) 입니다.<br><button class="bigbtn light" style="margin-top:8px" onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(it.reading)}')">🔊 발음 듣기</button><button class="bigbtn light" style="margin-top:8px;margin-left:6px" onclick="retryJlptItem()">↻ 같은 문제 다시 풀기</button></div>`;saveJlptSession();return}it.status='done';scheduleGenericReview(it.reviewKey,null,true);let ex=it.examples?.[0]||'';box.innerHTML=`<div class="practiceExplain">✅ <b>${escapeHtml(it.answer)}</b> <span style="color:#64748b">${escapeHtml(it.reading)}</span>${ex?`<br><br>${escapeHtml(ex)}`:''}<br><button class="bigbtn light" style="margin-top:8px" onclick="speakText('${encodeURIComponent(it.reading)}')">🔊 단어 듣기</button></div>${reviewScheduleButtonsGeneric(it.reviewKey)}<div style="display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px"><button class="bigbtn ghost" onclick="jlptRepeatCurrent()">🔁 뒤에서 다시</button><button class="bigbtn blue" onclick="advanceJlptItem()">다음 문제 →</button></div>`;if(state.autoSpeak)speak(it.reading);saveJlptSession()}
function retryJlptItem(){let it=jlptCurrent();if(!it)return;it.status='todo';renderJlptQuiz()}
function advanceJlptItem(){if(!jlptSession)return;let next=jlptSession.items.findIndex((x,i)=>i>jlptSession.idx&&x.status!=='done');if(next<0)next=jlptSession.items.findIndex(x=>x.status!=='done');if(next<0){finishJlptQuiz();return}jlptSession.idx=next;saveJlptSession();renderJlptQuiz()}
function jlptPrevious(){if(!jlptSession||jlptSession.idx<=0)return;jlptSession.idx--;saveJlptSession();renderJlptQuiz()}
function jlptNextNav(){let it=jlptCurrent();if(!it)return;if(it.status!=='done'&&!jlptSession.items.some(x=>x.isReview&&x.reviewOf===it.id&&x.status!=='done'))jlptSession.items.push({...it,id:it.id+'-skip-'+Date.now(),status:'todo',isReview:true,reviewOf:it.id,firstAnswered:true});jlptSession.idx=Math.min(jlptSession.items.length-1,jlptSession.idx+1);saveJlptSession();renderJlptQuiz()}
function jlptRepeatCurrent(){let it=jlptCurrent();if(!it)return;let root=it.reviewOf||it.id;if(!jlptSession.items.some(x=>x.isReview&&x.reviewOf===root&&x.status!=='done'))jlptSession.items.push({...it,id:it.id+'-manual-'+Date.now(),status:'todo',isReview:true,reviewOf:root,firstAnswered:true});toast('뒤쪽 복습에 추가했습니다.');saveJlptSession()}
function finishJlptQuiz(){if(!jlptSession)return;let pending=jlptSession.items.findIndex(x=>x.status!=='done');if(pending>=0){jlptSession.idx=pending;renderJlptQuiz();return}let s=jlptStat(jlptSession.level);s.sessions++;s.firstCorrect+=jlptSession.firstCorrect;s.firstTotal+=jlptSession.firstTotal;let level=jlptSession.level,base=jlptSession.baseCount,acc=jlptSession.firstTotal?Math.round(jlptSession.firstCorrect/jlptSession.firstTotal*100):0,review=jlptSession.items.filter(x=>x.isReview).length;touchStudyDay('jlpt');state.jlptSession=null;jlptSession=null;saveState();updateHome();document.getElementById('jlptProgress').style.width='100%';document.getElementById('jlptCount').textContent='완료';document.getElementById('jlptNotice').textContent='';document.getElementById('jlptQuizCard').innerHTML=`<div class="summary"><div class="trophy">🎯</div><h2>JLPT ${level} 단어 완료!</h2><div class="summaryGrid"><div><b>${base}</b><span>기본 문제</span></div><div><b>${acc}%</b><span>첫 시도 정확도</span></div><div><b>${review}</b><span>추가 복습</span></div><div><b>+12</b><span>랭킹 점수</span></div></div><button class="bigbtn blue" onclick="startJlptQuiz('${level}')">한 세트 더</button> <button class="bigbtn light" onclick="openJlptHub('${level}')">단어 목록</button></div>`}

window.DACOApp={
  getState:()=>JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(state)),
  getDefaultState:()=>JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(defaultState)),
  hasMeaningfulState:(x=state)=>!!(x&&(Number(x.totalSessions||0)>0||Object.keys(x.cards||{}).length>0||(x.history||[]).length>0||x.activeSession||x.lifeSession||x.jlptSession||Object.values(x.drills||{}).some(d=>Number(d?.sessions||0)>0)||Object.values(x.lifeDrills||{}).some(d=>Number(d?.sessions||0)>0)||(x.attendance||[]).length>0)),
  loadLocalForUser:(uid)=>{
    window.DACO_CLOUD_USER_ID=uid||'guest';
    state=loadState();state.cards=state.cards||{};state.roles=state.roles||{};state.history=Array.isArray(state.history)?state.history:[];state.jlptDrills=state.jlptDrills||{};ensureGamificationState(state);
    lesson=null;practiceSession=null;updateHome();return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(state));
  },
  applyExternalState:(next,opts={})=>{
    window.__DACOCloudApplying=true;
    try{
      state=Object.assign({},defaultState,next||{});state.cards=state.cards||{};state.roles=state.roles||{};state.history=Array.isArray(state.history)?state.history:[];state.jlptDrills=state.jlptDrills||{};ensureGamificationState(state);
      try{localStorage.setItem(stateKey(),JSON.stringify(state))}catch(e){}
      saveStateIDB(state);lesson=null;practiceSession=null;updateHome();
    }finally{window.__DACOCloudApplying=false}
    return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(state));
  },
  setGuestMode:()=>{window.DACO_CLOUD_USER_ID='guest';state=loadState();lesson=null;practiceSession=null;updateHome()},
  currentStorageKey:()=>stateKey(),
  summary:(x)=>{x=x||{};let g=scoreSummary(x);return {totalSessions:Number(x.totalSessions||0),streak:Number(x.streak||0),mode:x.mode||'beginner',learned:g.learned,history:(x.history||[]).length,lastStudy:x.lastStudy||'',drillSessions:g.drillSessions,lifeSessions:g.lifeSessions,score:g.score,attendanceDays:g.attendanceDays,firstAccuracy:g.firstAccuracy,updatedAt:Number(x._updatedAt||0)}},scoreSummary:(x)=>scoreSummary(x||state),hasStudiedToday:(x)=>hasStudiedToday(x||state)
};
updateHome();
initNavigationHistory();
hydrateFromIDB();
requestPersistentStorage();
